---
import PageLayout from "../../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
---

<PageLayout title="Tools — DreaMax | Gomoku & Mini Apps">
  <section class="min-h-screen px-6 pt-32 pb-24">
    <div class="mx-auto" style="max-width:960px;">
      <h1 class="section-heading" style="margin-bottom:8px;">
        <span class="accent-bar" style="background:#c586c0;"></span>Tools
      </h1>
      <p class="font-mono text-sm" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);">实用小工具和娱乐应用，持续增加中。</p>

      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2" style="margin-top:48px;">
        <!-- Gomoku Card -->
        <a href="/tools/gomoku" class="card rounded-sm border border-white/8 bg-[#131316]/60 backdrop-blur-sm p-6 hover:-translate-y-[3px] transition-all duration-300 hover:border-white/20 no-underline block">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-2xl">⚫</span>
              <span class="font-mono text-xs tracking-widest" style="color:#c586c0;">GAME</span>
            </div>
            <h2 class="font-sans text-xl font-semibold text-white">五子棋 · Gomoku</h2>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5); font-weight:300;">
              经典 15x15 五子棋，三种难度 AI 对手，带落子音效和背景音乐。黑棋先行，白棋 AI 自动应手。
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
              <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-white/8 px-3 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs text-white/35">AI 对战</span>
              <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-white/8 px-3 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs text-white/35">音效</span>
              <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-white/8 px-3 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs text-white/35">三档难度</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- Beautifier Card -->
        <a href="/tools/beautifier" class="card rounded-sm border border-white/8 bg-[#131316]/60 backdrop-blur-sm p-6 hover:-translate-y-[3px] transition-all duration-300 hover:border-white/20 no-underline block">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-2xl">✨</span>
              <span class="font-mono text-xs tracking-widest" style="color:#66d9ed;">PHOTO</span>
            </div>
            <h2 class="font-sans text-xl font-semibold text-white">DreaMax Beautifier</h2>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5); font-weight:300;">
              一键美颜工具。上传照片，调亮度/对比度/饱和度/美白/锐化，所有处理在本地完成，不上传服务器。
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
              <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-white/8 px-3 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs text-white/35">纯前端</span>
              <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-white/8 px-3 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs text-white/35">实时预览</span>
              <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-white/8 px-3 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs text-white/35">免费</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- More tools placeholder -->
        <!-- TempMail Card -->
        <a href="/tools/tempmail" class="card rounded-sm border border-white/8 bg-[#131316]/60 backdrop-blur-sm p-6 hover:-translate-y-[3px] transition-all duration-300 hover:border-white/20 no-underline block">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-2xl">📧</span>
              <span class="font-mono text-xs tracking-widest" style="color:#66d9ed;">UTILITY</span>
            </div>
            <h2 class="font-sans text-xl font-semibold text-white">TempMail</h2>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5); font-weight:300;">
              临时邮箱生成器。一键生成一次性邮箱，自动收件，无需注册，保护隐私。
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
              <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-white/8 px-3 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs text-white/35">免费 API</span>
              <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-white/8 px-3 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs text-white/35">自动收件</span>
              <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-white/8 px-3 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs text-white/35">零配置</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </a>
        <!-- Rewriter Card -->
        <a href="/tools/rewriter" class="card rounded-sm border border-white/8 bg-[#131316]/60 backdrop-blur-sm p-6 hover:-translate-y-[3px] transition-all duration-300 hover:border-white/20 no-underline block">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-2xl">✏️</span>
              <span class="font-mono text-xs tracking-widest" style="color:#e31b6d;">ACADEMIC</span>
            </div>
            <h2 class="font-sans text-xl font-semibold text-white">Paper Rewriter</h2>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5); font-weight:300;">
              论文/作业查重 + AI 改写降重。上传文本，模拟查重率分析，Hugging Face AI 辅助改写。
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
              <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-white/8 px-3 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs text-white/35">查重分析</span>
              <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-white/8 px-3 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs text-white/35">AI 改写</span>
              <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-white/8 px-3 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs text-white/35">免费 API</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </a>
        <!-- Checkin Card -->
        <a href="/tools/checkin" class="card rounded-sm border border-white/8 bg-[#131316]/60 backdrop-blur-sm p-6 hover:-translate-y-[3px] transition-all duration-300 hover:border-white/20 no-underline block">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-2xl">✅</span>
              <span class="font-mono text-xs tracking-widest" style="color:#e31b6d;">SELF-DISCIPLINE</span>
            </div>
            <h2 class="font-sans text-xl font-semibold text-white">DreaMax 自律打卡器</h2>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5); font-weight:300;">
              每日打卡 + 英语四六级/考研单词学习。自我管理、数据记录、羞耻警告与鼓励奖励机制。
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
              <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-white/8 px-3 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs text-white/35">打卡</span>
              <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-white/8 px-3 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs text-white/35">单词</span>
              <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-white/8 px-3 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs text-white/35">统计</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </a>
        <!-- MBTI Card -->
        <a href="/tools/mbti" class="card rounded-sm border border-white/8 bg-[#131316]/60 backdrop-blur-sm p-6 hover:-translate-y-[3px] transition-all duration-300 hover:border-white/20 no-underline block">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-2xl">🧠</span>
              <span class="font-mono text-xs tracking-widest" style="color:#c586c0;">PERSONALITY</span>
            </div>
            <h2 class="font-sans text-xl font-semibold text-white">DreaMax MBTI</h2>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5); font-weight:300;">
              60 题完整 MBTI 人格测试。测出你的 16 型人格，附详细类型解析。
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
              <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-white/8 px-3 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs text-white/35">60 题</span>
              <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-white/8 px-3 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs text-white/35">4 维度</span>
              <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-white/8 px-3 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs text-white/35">16 类型</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </a>
        <!-- FileShare Card -->
        <a href="/tools/fileshare" class="card rounded-sm border border-white/8 bg-[#131316]/60 backdrop-blur-sm p-6 hover:-translate-y-[3px] transition-all duration-300 hover:border-white/20 no-underline block">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-2xl">📦</span>
              <span class="font-mono text-xs tracking-widest" style="color:#66d9ed;">CLOUD</span>
            </div>
            <h2 class="font-sans text-xl font-semibold text-white">DreaMax 文件速递</h2>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5); font-weight:300;">
              上传文件 → 生成提取码 → 安全分享。10GB+ 云存储，不过期。支持邮箱注册登录。
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
              <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-white/8 px-3 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs text-white/35">10GB</span>
              <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-white/8 px-3 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs text-white/35">提取码</span>
              <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-white/8 px-3 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs text-white/35">邮箱登录</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
